+++ b/changelog/unreleased/2026-11-26-icu-on-demand.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+- Windows: `icu.dll` and its word dictionaries load on their own thread the first time word boundaries are asked for (a double-click, word movement, or text in Thai, Lao, Khmer, Burmese, Chinese or Japanese), still never before the first frame, instead of after every launch's first frame. An app whose text never asks loads none of it (about 800 KB and a thread).
